WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.560 --> 00:00:04.960
Longmire thrilled fans with its depiction&nbsp;
of life out west. Season after season,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:04.960 --> 00:00:08.960
secrets about the residents of its&nbsp;
small town are revealed. In the end,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:08.960 --> 00:00:13.040
all of them come crashing together,&nbsp;
creating one majorly compelling drama.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:13.040 --> 00:00:16.880
Let's catch up with its talented cast and&nbsp;
see what trails they're heading down now.

00:00:17.440 --> 00:00:21.760
Robert Taylor completely embodies the&nbsp;
small town, cowboy-like Sheriff Longmire.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:21.760 --> 00:00:27.200
His performance is as powerful as it is nuanced&nbsp;
— you'd think he grew up alongside the likes of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:27.200 --> 00:00:32.720
John Wayne and Clint Eastwood. Fun fact: He's not&nbsp;
American at all! Taylor is actually Australian,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:32.720 --> 00:00:36.160
and should absolutely get an&nbsp;
award for fooling everyone.

00:00:36.160 --> 00:00:40.480
Since starring on Longmire, Taylor has been&nbsp;
busy living life off-screen in Melbourne,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:40.480 --> 00:00:44.320
Australia. His Instagram is filled with&nbsp;
pictures of him getting beers with friends,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:44.320 --> 00:00:48.240
rooting on the Dodgers, and traveling.&nbsp;
He even made a trip back to Wyoming.

00:00:48.240 --> 00:00:53.680
If you miss watching the Sheriff on screen, you&nbsp;
can see Taylor as Dr. Heller in the 2018 film&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:53.680 --> 00:00:57.600
The Meg, or as Reverend Covern in&nbsp;
the "Down from Dover'' episode of the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:57.600 --> 00:01:02.400
delightful Dolly Parton's Heartstrings.&nbsp;
Anyone associated with Dolly while also&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:02.400 --> 00:01:05.920
living his best life surrounded by&nbsp;
friends and family is doing it right.

00:01:06.480 --> 00:01:11.360
The will-they-won't-they relationship between&nbsp;
deputy sheriff Vic Moretti and Walt Longmire&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:11.360 --> 00:01:15.360
features throughout the entire series.&nbsp;
And while they decide to live together,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:15.360 --> 00:01:19.440
their past relationships never allow&nbsp;
them to fully commit to one another.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:19.440 --> 00:01:23.600
This badass detective is played by&nbsp;
the equally awesome Katee Sackhoff.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:23.600 --> 00:01:28.800
Moretti is tough, layered, and intelligent, much&nbsp;
like the other characters Sackhoff portrays.

00:01:28.800 --> 00:01:34.160
Since her time on Longmire, Sackhoff has been&nbsp;
continuously working — often in major franchises.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:34.160 --> 00:01:38.880
In the Arrowverse, she plays Amunet Black on&nbsp;
The Flash. She also wields the power of her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:38.880 --> 00:01:45.040
voice playing various characters on Robot Chicken.&nbsp;
But she is perhaps best known as Bo-Katan Kryze.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:45.040 --> 00:01:49.520
Sackhoff originally only played her on the&nbsp;
animated Star Wars: The Clone Wars series,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:49.520 --> 00:01:55.200
but Dave Filoni and Jon Favreau decided to bring&nbsp;
Bo-Katan to life in season two of The Mandalorian,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:55.200 --> 00:01:57.200
inviting Katee Sackhoff along for the ride.

00:01:58.320 --> 00:01:59.840
"Some of us serve a higher purpose."

00:02:00.640 --> 00:02:04.960
If you're looking for even more of Sackhoff's&nbsp;
brilliance, look no further than Netflix.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:04.960 --> 00:02:09.200
She stars as Niko Breckinridge on the&nbsp;
sci-fi thriller series Another Life.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:09.200 --> 00:02:14.000
It's safe to say that this hard working woman&nbsp;
and friend of Baby Yoda is already a legend.

00:02:14.480 --> 00:02:18.800
A resident of the Cheyenne reservation,&nbsp;
owner of The Red Pony, and accused killer,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:18.800 --> 00:02:22.240
Henry Standing Bear is a&nbsp;
longtime friend of Walt Longmire.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:22.240 --> 00:02:26.160
The connection between the two, paired with&nbsp;
Lou Diamond Philips' engaging portrayal,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:26.160 --> 00:02:29.280
made this character one of the&nbsp;
most prominent pieces of the show.

00:02:29.280 --> 00:02:34.880
Philips is not new to the Hollywood scene.&nbsp;
In 1987, he received rave reviews for his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:34.880 --> 00:02:40.080
portrayal of Ritchie Valens in La Bamba. His&nbsp;
career continued to thrive with a Tony Award&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:40.080 --> 00:02:44.640
nomination for The King and I, and a Golden&nbsp;
Globe nomination for Stand and Deliver.

00:02:44.640 --> 00:02:48.480
Since the finale of Longmire,&nbsp;
Philips' success has known no bounds.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:48.480 --> 00:02:52.960
He's actually a world-class poker player,&nbsp;
frequently playing in major tournaments. Guess&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:52.960 --> 00:02:58.080
his stoic persona as Henry Standing Bear comes&nbsp;
in handy even beyond Longmire. Even though he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:58.080 --> 00:03:02.800
hasn't managed to win big at the World Series of&nbsp;
Poker yet, you never know how the chips will fall.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:02.800 --> 00:03:08.000
While you wait for his epic victory, you can catch&nbsp;
him on the Fox series Prodigal Son as Gil Arroyo.

00:03:08.480 --> 00:03:12.800
If Cassidy Freeman looks familiar, it's&nbsp;
because you probably remember her as Tess&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:12.800 --> 00:03:16.960
Mercer on the hit show Smallville. After&nbsp;
her tenure on the Superman drama ended,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:16.960 --> 00:03:21.920
she stepped into the shoes of Cady Longmire.&nbsp;
Cady, or Punk as she's affectionately known,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:21.920 --> 00:03:26.800
is a lawyer, Sheriff Longmire's daughter, and&nbsp;
Branch's girlfriend. Henry's arrest sends her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:26.800 --> 00:03:30.560
career in a new direction as a public&nbsp;
defender for members of the reservation.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:30.560 --> 00:03:34.080
The series ends with her following&nbsp;
her father's sheriff path.

00:03:34.080 --> 00:03:38.160
Freeman is a woman of many talents. She's&nbsp;
in an indie rock band with her brother,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:38.160 --> 00:03:43.200
called The Real D'Coy. She's also politically&nbsp;
and socially active, volunteering her time in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:43.200 --> 00:03:48.560
support of Jon Ossoff during the 2020 election.&nbsp;
On screen, she's kept busy with roles on the big&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:48.560 --> 00:03:53.920
screen in 2021's The Forever Purge and on the&nbsp;
small screen in HBO's The Righteous Gemstones.

00:03:54.800 --> 00:04:00.160
"God, I have hitched my wagon to a&nbsp;
force for good. Ain't I lucky ladies?"

00:04:00.160 --> 00:04:01.760
"Yeah. Lucky."

00:04:01.760 --> 00:04:06.880
Freeman absolutely shines in every role she&nbsp;
tackles and will likely continue to do so.

00:04:08.126 --> 00:04:11.600
Bailey Chase is Branch Connally,&nbsp;
an affluent and ambitious detective&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:11.600 --> 00:04:16.560
and the on-again-off-again boyfriend of&nbsp;
Cady Longmire. In a tragic turn of events,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:16.560 --> 00:04:20.720
soon after Branch is kicked off the&nbsp;
force, he's killed by his own father.

00:04:20.720 --> 00:04:24.560
Like his character, Chase played football&nbsp;
at Duke University on a scholarship.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:24.560 --> 00:04:28.640
Luckily for us, he became an actor, and&nbsp;
has been working steadily for years.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:28.640 --> 00:04:33.680
After playing the disgraced deputy, he&nbsp;
joined the casts of 24: Legacy, Twin Peaks,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:33.680 --> 00:04:39.200
and S.W.A.T. He also reunited with his Longmire&nbsp;
castmate A Martinez on Queen of the South.

00:04:39.200 --> 00:04:44.560
Chase's frequently updated Instagram is&nbsp;
particularly fun for Longmire fans to peruse. It's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:44.560 --> 00:04:49.600
filled with adorable pictures of his family, pets,&nbsp;
travels, and passions. Take a closer look, and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:49.600 --> 00:04:51.487
you'll discover his handle is @branchlives. Turns&nbsp;
out, he loves Branch Connally as much as we do.

00:04:52.400 --> 00:04:54.480
A member of the Cheyenne reservation's tribal&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:54.480 --> 00:04:58.640
police force, Officer Mathias is a&nbsp;
frequent thorn in Longmire's side.

00:04:58.640 --> 00:05:00.560
"It's a bit over the top to cuff him."

00:05:00.560 --> 00:05:02.720
"Well he didn't have permission&nbsp;
to operate on the Rez."

00:05:03.440 --> 00:05:05.200
Mathias is a bit of an enigma,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:05.200 --> 00:05:09.760
forcing the audience to constantly question&nbsp;
if he's working towards good or bad aims.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:09.760 --> 00:05:15.120
This uncertainty leads to an incredibly nuanced&nbsp;
and dynamic performance from Zahn McClarnon.

00:05:15.120 --> 00:05:19.200
As a Native American actor of Lakota&nbsp;
descent, McClarnon is part of a small&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:19.200 --> 00:05:24.720
minority of working indigenous actors. UCLA's&nbsp;
"Hollywood Diversity Report" revealed only&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:24.720 --> 00:05:31.040
0.5 percent of top film roles were played by&nbsp;
Native American actors as recently as 2019.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:31.040 --> 00:05:33.680
Even though the industry should be&nbsp;
more inclusive across the board,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:33.680 --> 00:05:38.880
McClarnon's casting as Officer Mathias is&nbsp;
enormously important and forward-thinking.

00:05:38.880 --> 00:05:42.400
McClarnon's career is filled with&nbsp;
unique and interesting roles.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:42.400 --> 00:05:46.800
He played Hanzee Dent in the second season&nbsp;
of Fargo and the critically acclaimed role&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:46.800 --> 00:05:52.560
of Akecheta on Westworld. In 2021, he'll&nbsp;
appear as William Lopez on Marvel's Hawkeye.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:52.560 --> 00:05:57.280
McClarnon is breaking barriers for indigenous&nbsp;
actors and is kicking butt while doing it.

00:05:57.760 --> 00:06:02.880
A seemingly bumbling addition to the team, Deputy&nbsp;
Archie "the Ferg" Ferguson is just a diamond in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:02.880 --> 00:06:07.760
the rough. His relationship with Longmire&nbsp;
is filled with heart and mutual admiration.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:07.760 --> 00:06:12.240
When Ferguson tries to resign, he gets one&nbsp;
of the series' most heartbreaking lines:

00:06:12.240 --> 00:06:17.360
"I know I was a favor. I only got hired&nbsp;
'cause you were helping out my dad."

00:06:18.800 --> 00:06:21.680
The strong bond between him&nbsp;
and Longmire shines through,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:21.680 --> 00:06:25.680
as Longmire refuses the resignation,&nbsp;
still seeing potential in Ferguson.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:25.680 --> 00:06:29.280
Thank goodness for that, because the show&nbsp;
wouldn't be the same without the Ferg.

00:06:29.280 --> 00:06:34.880
Since Longmire, Adam Bartley has appeared on&nbsp;
a plethora of great shows. He plays Carl Brown&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:34.880 --> 00:06:40.720
on NCIS: Los Angeles, Erik Doyle on Lucifer,&nbsp;
and Duke on This Is Us. Hopefully, he'll soon&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:40.720 --> 00:06:45.520
play another wonderful series regular role like&nbsp;
Deputy Ferguson. In the meantime, his Instagram&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:45.520 --> 00:06:50.320
is filled with joy, including his adorable animals&nbsp;
and reunion photos with his Longmire cast members.

00:06:50.880 --> 00:06:55.200
Perhaps the most disliked character on&nbsp;
Longmire, business opportunist and Cheyenne&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:55.200 --> 00:07:00.320
tribal committee member Jacob Nighthorse is&nbsp;
brilliantly portrayed by A Martinez. As with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:00.320 --> 00:07:05.200
all the multilayered characters on this show,&nbsp;
there is more to Nighthorse than meets the eye.

00:07:05.200 --> 00:07:10.160
Martinez is able to walk the line of being&nbsp;
beyond despicable and remarkably engaging,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:10.160 --> 00:07:12.560
creating a stand-out performance in Longmire.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:12.560 --> 00:07:17.280
The semi-pro baseball player-turned-actor&nbsp;
began his career in film, but is best known&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:17.280 --> 00:07:22.320
for his work on soap operas. After wrapping on&nbsp;
Longmire, he found a home again in soap operas,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:22.320 --> 00:07:28.080
playing Eduardo "Eddie" Hernandez on NBC's Days&nbsp;
of Our Lives. If his top-shelf acting on Longmire&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:28.080 --> 00:07:32.720
is any indication of what he brings to Days of&nbsp;
Our Lives, he deserves all the Daytime Emmys.

